@host http://localhost:5263
@apiKey = dev-partner-api-key

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Dummy partner verification
GET {{host}}/internal/v1/partners/P-1001/verify

### Accept a partner transaction
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### Rejected: amount must be greater than 0
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 0,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}

### Rejected: missing API key
POST {{host}}/api/v1/partner/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerId": "P-1001",
  "transactionReference": "TXN-99823",
  "amount": 250.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "timestamp": "2024-05-10T14:30:00Z"
}
